  "summary_en": "Chile's first National AI Policy, prepared by MinCiencia with an expert committee and public consultation. It sets a goal of leading Latin America in AI by 2031, built on four principles and three axes: enabling factors (talent, infrastructure, data), development and adoption, and ethics, legal and socioeconomic impacts.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Goal: exceed OECD average and lead Latin America and the Caribbean in AI by 2031",
